					<h1>About</h1>
				
					<p>Crumb&Co. came from the idea of slowing down and enjoying the simplicity of a cup of coffee. Our goal was to create an environment that feels warm and familiar, fostering a space for rest and connection. What started off as an idea for a cafe quickly expanded to a bakery. Heavily inspired by French patisseries, we worked with bakers to design a menu full of delicately crafted pastries and bread. At Crumb&Co., we value the quality and authenticity of our goods, which is why everything we sell is freshly baked every morning.</p>
			  
